# FoodSave Smart Frontend

Responsible team member: Florin

This folder contains the website interface for FoodSave Smart.

## Planned features

- Dashboard displaying temperature, humidity and connection status.
- Food inventory with preparation and expiry information.
- Food status and alerts supplied by the backend.
- Manual temperature entry when automatic readings are unavailable.

## Collaboration

Develop changes on a separate branch, such as `feature/frontend`.

Open a Draft Pull Request targeting `main` while work is ongoing.
Select Ready for review when the changes are ready to be checked.

Agree API endpoints and response fields with the backend developer
before connecting the interface.

Do not upload passwords, tokens, `.env` files or `node_modules`.
Document how to install and run the frontend in this README.
